{"3887110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCHOOL EXIT CLASS 8", "steam_appid": 3887110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Something happened at this school—long ago.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SCHOOL EXIT CLASS 8</i> is a first-person horror game where you wander through looping hallways in search of subtle anomalies. There is only one rule:<br><strong>If you notice something strange, turn back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classrooms, restrooms, the nurse’s office—<br>No matter where you go, <strong>the Eye</strong> is watching, and <strong>the Hand</strong> is reaching for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden within the anomalies are fragments of a tragedy that once occurred at this school.<br><strong>Can you uncover the reason you’re trapped here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Features<br>• 51 eerie anomalies in the full version<br>• Explore not just hallways, but also classrooms, restrooms, and the nurse’s office<br>• Short, 5–15 minute looping sessions focused on observation<br>• Haunted by the <strong>Grudgeful Eye</strong> and <strong>Cursed Hand</strong> that follow your every move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you reach the exit…</strong><br><br><br><br><strong>or will it be someone else—someone inside you?</strong><br><br><strong></strong>School Exit – An Exit 8-Like Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We allow influencers and content creators to stream, share gameplay videos, and monetize content of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* update 20250809 　</strong>Bug Fixes and Improvements</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Something happened at this school—long ago.</strong></